# The guest build tree + the compiled wasm artifacts are never committed (built on demand via
# `xtask build-guests`). Cargo.lock IS committed (B3 sitting 2): without it, registry patch
# versions float between builds and every SDK-linking guest's bytes (and its guests.blake3 pin)
# drift over time — the lockfile is what makes the byte-identity gate reproducible.
/target
*.wasm
